<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>SnapMoment | Visitor Photo Slideshow</title><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Manrope:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/style.css"></head><body>
<header class="header"><a class="brand" href="#">✳ snap<span>moment</span></a><nav><a href="#how">How it works</a><a href="#gallery">Gallery</a><a href="display.php" target="_blank">Display screen ↗</a><a href="admin/login.php">Admin</a></nav></header>
<main><section class="hero"><div class="copy"><small class="eyebrow">● YOUR MOMENTS, TOGETHER</small><h1>Every moment<br>deserves a <em>big screen.</em></h1><p>Share your photos from the event and watch the memories come together in one live gallery.</p><button class="primary" id="start">Share your photos <b>→</b></button><small class="trust">✓ Your photos are reviewed before they go live.</small></div><div class="art"><div class="blob"></div><div class="photo main-photo"><div class="sunset">☀</div><b>Little moments</b><small>MAKE THE BEST MEMORIES</small></div><div class="photo mini mini-one">✿</div><div class="photo mini mini-two">☺</div><div class="photo mini mini-three">✦</div><div class="tag">● A gallery made by you</div></div></section>
<section class="how" id="how"><small class="eyebrow">SIMPLE AS ONE, TWO, THREE</small><h2>Be part of the picture.</h2><div class="steps"><article><b>01</b><i>↗</i><h3>Tell us it's you</h3><p>Enter your name. We'll create a unique visitor ID for your photos.</p></article><article><b>02</b><i>▧</i><h3>Share your photos</h3><p>Choose your favourite moments and upload multiple photos in one go.</p></article><article><b>03</b><i>✦</i><h3>See them together</h3><p>After review, approved photos join the event slideshow on the big screen.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="gallery" id="gallery"><div><small class="eyebrow">ONE SHARED GALLERY</small><h2>Different people.<br><em>One beautiful story.</em></h2><p>Approved photos from everyone, together.</p><div class="gallery-grid" id="publicGallery"><p>Approved photos will appear here.</p></div></section></main><footer><a class="brand" href="#">✳ snap<span>moment</span></a><small>Made for moments worth sharing. · © 2026</small></footer>
<div class="backdrop" id="modal" hidden><section class="dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true"><button class="close" id="close">×</button><small class="eyebrow">LET'S GET STARTED · STEP 1</small><h2>First, who's sharing?</h2><p>Enter your name to get started. Your photos will be connected to a unique visitor ID.</p><form id="visitorForm"><label for="name">Your name</label><input id="name" placeholder="e.g. Priya Sharma" required minlength="2"><label for="visitorCode">Returning visitor? Enter Visitor ID (optional)</label><input id="visitorCode" placeholder="e.g. VIS00001" autocomplete="off"><small class="helper">No email needed. Keep your Visitor ID to retrieve photos on another device.</small><button class="primary full">Continue to photo upload →</button><small class="note">Your profile will be saved securely in the SnapMoment database.</small></form><p id="message" role="status"></p></section></div>
<div class="backdrop upload-backdrop" id="uploadModal" hidden><section class="dialog upload-dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true"><button class="close" id="uploadClose">×</button><small class="eyebrow">STEP 2 · SHARE THE MOMENTS</small><h2 id="uploadTitle">Add your photos<span class="accent-dot">.</span></h2><p id="welcomeText">Choose the moments you want to share.</p><small class="note" id="visitorBadge" hidden></small><label class="dropzone" id="dropzone" for="photoInput"><span class="upload-icon">↑</span><strong>Drag & drop your photos here</strong><span>or <u>browse files</u></span><small>JPG, PNG or WEBP · Up to 20 photos</small></label><input class="file-input" type="file" id="photoInput" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" multiple><div class="preview-grid" id="previewGrid"></div><label class="consent-row"><input type="checkbox" id="photoConsent"> I confirm these photos are okay to share at this event.</label><div class="upload-actions"><button class="secondary" id="backToName" type="button">Back</button><button class="primary" id="finishUpload" type="button">Upload photos →</button></div><p id="uploadMessage" role="status"></p></section></div><script src="assets/js/app.js"></script></body></html>
